          <div class="mb-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" fill="currentColor" class="text-primary" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 3.5a.5.5 0 0 0-1 0V9a.5.5 0 0 0 .252.434l3.5 2a.5.5 0 0 0 .496-.868L8 8.71z"/><path d="M8 16A8 8 0 1 0 8 0a8 8 0 0 0 0 16m7-8A7 7 0 1 1 1 8a7 7 0 0 1 14 0"/></svg></div>
